  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HEB 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Concluding Exhortations",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keep on loving one another as brothers and sisters.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not forget to show hospitality to strangers, for by so doing some people have shown hospitality to angels without knowing it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Continue to remember those in prison as if you were together with them in prison, and those who are mistreated as if you yourselves were suffering.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Marriage should be honored by all, and the marriage bed kept pure, for God will judge the adulterer and all the sexually immoral.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keep your lives free from the love of money and be content with what you have, because God has said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 13:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Never will I leave you;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 13:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "never will I forsake you.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So we say with confidence,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 13:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"The Lord is my helper; I will not be afraid.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 13:6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "What can mere mortals do to me?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remember your leaders, who spoke the word of God to you. Consider the outcome of their way of life and imitate their faith.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus Christ is the same yesterday and today and forever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not be carried away by all kinds of strange teachings. It is good for our hearts to be strengthened by grace, not by eating ceremonial foods, which is of no benefit to those who do so.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We have an altar from which those who minister at the tabernacle have no right to eat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The high priest carries the blood of animals into the Most Holy Place as a sin offering, but the bodies are burned outside the camp.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And so Jesus also suffered outside the city gate to make the people holy through his own blood.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let us, then, go to him outside the camp, bearing the disgrace he bore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For here we do not have an enduring city, but we are looking for the city that is to come.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Through Jesus, therefore, let us continually offer to God a sacrifice of praise—the fruit of lips that openly profess his name.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And do not forget to do good and to share with others, for with such sacrifices God is pleased.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Have confidence in your leaders and submit to their authority, because they keep watch over you as those who must give an account. Do this so that their work will be a joy, not a burden, for that would be of no benefit to you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pray for us. We are sure that we have a clear conscience and desire to live honorably in every way.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I particularly urge you to pray so that I may be restored to you soon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Benediction and Final Greetings",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now may the God of peace, who through the blood of the eternal covenant brought back from the dead our Lord Jesus, that great Shepherd of the sheep,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "equip you with everything good for doing his will, and may he work in us what is pleasing to him, through Jesus Christ, to whom be glory for ever and ever. Amen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Brothers and sisters, I urge you to bear with my word of exhortation, for in fact I have written to you quite briefly.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I want you to know that our brother Timothy has been released. If he arrives soon, I will come with him to see you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Greet all your leaders and all the Lord's people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "HEB 13:24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Those from Italy send you their greetings.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Grace be with you all.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.13.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
